# ArtCloset — Product Overview

**Version:** 1.0.0 (Free offline catalog · Android APK target)  
**Category:** Offline-first personal art vault & catalog  
**Platform:** Android-first; iOS and web present in codebase (React Native / Expo)  
**Android package / iOS bundle ID:** `com.dukenizer.artcloset`  
**Scheme:** `artcloset`

**Roadmap:** [docs/ROADMAP.md](docs/ROADMAP.md) · **Monetization:** [docs/MONETIZATION-STRATEGY.md](docs/MONETIZATION-STRATEGY.md)

---

## Executive Summary

ArtCloset is a private, offline-first mobile application that helps artists and collectors **list, describe, and share** artworks without accounts, backends, or cloud dependency.

The product thesis: **most makers and collectors do not need another social marketplace—they need a trustworthy personal vault that works offline, respects privacy, and stays fast on a phone.**

This **Free v1 APK** includes structured local storage (SQLite), managed artwork images, collections, search and filters, featured Home gallery, exhibit presentation, labels, share cards, buyer email, digital calling card, and explicit local export. There is **no subscription paywall** and **no Google Drive backup** in this release—Drive and Premium documents are roadmap items.

**Brand pillars:** *List · Describe · Share*  
**Tagline:** *Your art, offline first.*  
**Eyebrow:** *Your work. Your device.*

