## Core Value Proposition

| Pillar | Product angle |
|--------|----------------|
| **Offline-first** | Zero server COGS per active user; works without connectivity; SQLite + on-device images |
| **No account required** | Frictionless onboarding; no auth infrastructure; lower support and compliance surface |
| **Trust & privacy** | Data stays on device; export is explicit user action; no analytics in v1 |
| **List · Describe · Share** | Capture once, then filter, present, label, email, and export without leaving the vault |
| **Collections** | Many-to-many grouping so works can live in multiple contexts (shows, years, themes) |

