## Artwork Catalog (v1)

### Capture & images

- Photograph or pick; **Android** native freeform crop + rotate + re-crop
- Images resized, JPEG-encoded under `…/artcloset/images/`
- **Batch upload** Android-capable; iOS/web capability-gated

### Describe

Title, artist (As me / other), year/month, descriptions, medium, material, dimensions, orientation, framed, status, price, tags, genres, collections, **Set as featured** (edit Basic entry).

### Share & present

- Exhibit Mode, exhibit labels, share card, email selection, digital calling card

